<title>SINGAPORE: SES' 1996 trading volume down 19-pct year-on-year.</title>
<headline>SES' 1996 trading volume down 19-pct year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Singapore's (SES) trading volume in 1996 fell 19 percent year-on-year with 30.5 billion shares traded, state television said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It also said main board market capitalisation at Singapore $255.9 billion was off 9.5 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
